# =============================================================================
# Root .dockerignore — the build context for ALL images is the repo root, so
# THIS file (not apps/*/.dockerignore) governs what is sent to the daemon.
# Keep secrets, VCS, and heavy artifacts OUT of the build context.
# =============================================================================

# Dependencies & build output (reinstalled/rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/build

# Secrets & local env (NEVER ship these into an image/context)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# VCS & tooling
.git
.gitignore
.github
.husky
.vscode
.idea

# Tests (not needed at build/runtime)
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.e2e-spec.ts
**/test
**/__tests__

# Android (built on a real machine, not in the API/dashboard images)
apps/android-tv-player

# Local data, logs, backups, storage
**/*.log
.storage
backups
**/.DS_Store

# Docs / infra not needed by the app images (infra is mounted, not built in)
docs
